---
---
<div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center text-white my-12 relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
    <div class="relative z-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif mb-4"><span data-i18n="lead-title">想要專屬的財務健檢報告？</span></h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            <span data-i18n="lead-desc">留下您的 Email，我們將免費寄送一份「高淨值人士必備的 5 大稅務與配置檢查清單」給您。</span>
        </p>
        <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto" action="https://formspree.io/f/xvzvlvwa" method="POST">
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required
                class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors" />
            <button type="submit"
                class="px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-xl font-medium transition-colors shadow-lg">
                <span data-i18n="lead-btn">免費領取</span>
            </button>
        </form>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-4"><span data-i18n="lead-spam">我們保證不會發送垃圾郵件，隨時可以取消訂閱。</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Background Decor -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-16 -mr-16 w-64 h-64 bg-slate-800 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -mb-16 -ml-16 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-900 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-2xl"></div>
</div>
